<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.885 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.885 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 mln   5.885	 5.84-5.90   5.803</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 22)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 mln   5.891	 5.82-5.90   5.738 (Feb 5)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 45)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 mln   5.885	 5.85-5.90   5.795</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 13)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
